# Cursor Rules

## Shadcn UI & Styling
- **Priority**: Always use `shadcn/ui` components as provided in the project (@workspace/ui).
- **No Custom Tailwind**: Avoid adding custom Tailwind CSS utility classes for styling that deviates from standard `shadcn/ui` patterns. Use pure code as per official `shadcn/ui` examples.
- **Consistent Layout**: Use standard spacing and padding (e.g., `space-y-6`, `p-6`) across all forms and sheets.

## Sheet Component Guidelines
- **No Global Modification**: Do NOT modify the base `Sheet` components in the UI package (e.g., `@workspace/ui/components/sheet.tsx`).
- **Local Sizing**: Sizing must be handled in the component where the `Sheet` is used.
- **Responsive Width**: Use `className="w-full sm:max-w-[800px]"` on `SheetContent` to ensure full width on mobile and 800px width on desktop devices.
- **Structure**:
    - `SheetHeader` should contain `SheetTitle` and `SheetDescription`.
    - Main content should be wrapped in a `ScrollArea` with a inner container having `className="space-y-6 p-6"`.
    - `SheetFooter` should be placed outside the `ScrollArea` if a sticky footer is required.

## Code Quality
- **Cleanup**: Proactively remove unused imports, icons (Lucide), and variables after refactoring.
- **Linting**: Ensure no lint errors remain after modifications.
- **Standardized Forms**: Use `react-hook-form` with `zod` resolvers and standard `Field`, `FieldLabel`, `FieldDescription`, `FieldGroup`, `FieldSet` components from the UI package.

## Reference Examples

### Field & Form Layout
```tsx
import { Button } from "@workspace/ui/components/button"
import { Checkbox } from "@workspace/ui/components/checkbox"
import {
  Field,
  FieldDescription,
  FieldGroup,
  FieldLabel,
  FieldLegend,
  FieldSeparator,
  FieldSet,
} from "@workspace/ui/components/field"
import { Input } from "@workspace/ui/components/input"
import {
  Select,
  SelectContent,
  SelectGroup,
  SelectItem,
  SelectTrigger,
  SelectValue,
} from "@workspace/ui/components/select"
import { Textarea } from "@workspace/ui/components/textarea"

export function FieldDemo() {
  return (
    <div className="w-full max-w-md">
      <form>
        <FieldGroup>
          <FieldSet>
            <FieldLegend>Thông tin thanh toán</FieldLegend>
            <FieldDescription>
              Tất cả giao dịch được mã hóa an toàn.
            </FieldDescription>
            <FieldGroup>
              <Field>
                <FieldLabel htmlFor="card-name">Tên trên thẻ</FieldLabel>
                <Input id="card-name" placeholder="Nguyễn Văn A" required />
              </Field>
              <Field>
                <FieldLabel htmlFor="card-number">Số thẻ</FieldLabel>
                <Input id="card-number" placeholder="1234 5678 9012 3456" required />
                <FieldDescription>Nhập 16 số trên thẻ của bạn.</FieldDescription>
              </Field>
              <div className="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                <Field>
                  <FieldLabel htmlFor="exp-month">Tháng</FieldLabel>
                  <Select defaultValue="">
                    <SelectTrigger id="exp-month">
                      <SelectValue placeholder="MM" />
                    </SelectTrigger>
                    <SelectContent>
                      <SelectGroup>
                        <SelectItem value="01">01</SelectItem>
                        <SelectItem value="02">02</SelectItem>
                      </SelectGroup>
                    </SelectContent>
                  </Select>
                </Field>
                <Field>
                  <FieldLabel htmlFor="cvv">CVV</FieldLabel>
                  <Input id="cvv" placeholder="123" required />
                </Field>
              </div>
            </FieldGroup>
          </FieldSet>
          <FieldSeparator />
          <Field orientation="horizontal">
            <Button type="submit">Gửi</Button>
            <Button variant="outline" type="button">Hủy</Button>
          </Field>
        </FieldGroup>
      </form>
    </div>
  )
}
```

